    "name": "Mind of War",
    "steam_appid": 2960010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based <strong>strategy</strong> game that immerses you in an epic fantasy world, with a variety of clashes to test your cunning and wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you unlock new units and abilities, as well as improving their combat capabilities, allowing you to face new challenges and try new tactics. There are a variety of factions, each with their own particular style of combat, and each with a large repertoire of units, from basic infantry, heroes, giant creatures, menacing war machines and, of course, magical entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/60ad6cfc76604d92bb5ba5040a273333.poster.avif?t=1755247878\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/60ad6cfc76604d92bb5ba5040a273333.webm?t=1755247878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/60ad6cfc76604d92bb5ba5040a273333.mp4?t=1755247878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is a challenge, an opposing array to defeat, forcing you to decide which units to use, what skills and abilities you will need, and once the battle is underway, how to move between blows to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the multiplayer mode where you can take on your friends. Compatible with Steam Remote Play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/94d0dec164a65ee501b45e6b88716ace.poster.avif?t=1755247878\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/94d0dec164a65ee501b45e6b88716ace.webm?t=1755247878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/94d0dec164a65ee501b45e6b88716ace.mp4?t=1755247878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(It Requires one person to own the full version of the game).</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based <strong>strategy</strong> game that immerses you in an epic fantasy world, with a variety of clashes to test your cunning and wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you unlock new units and abilities, as well as improving their combat capabilities, allowing you to face new challenges and try new tactics. There are a variety of factions, each with their own particular style of combat, and each with a large repertoire of units, from basic infantry, heroes, giant creatures, menacing war machines and, of course, magical entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/60ad6cfc76604d92bb5ba5040a273333.poster.avif?t=1755247878\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/60ad6cfc76604d92bb5ba5040a273333.webm?t=1755247878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/60ad6cfc76604d92bb5ba5040a273333.mp4?t=1755247878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle is a challenge, an opposing array to defeat, forcing you to decide which units to use, what skills and abilities you will need, and once the battle is underway, how to move between blows to achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the multiplayer mode where you can take on your friends. Compatible with Steam Remote Play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/94d0dec164a65ee501b45e6b88716ace.poster.avif?t=1755247878\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/94d0dec164a65ee501b45e6b88716ace.webm?t=1755247878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960010/extras/94d0dec164a65ee501b45e6b88716ace.mp4?t=1755247878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(It Requires one person to own the full version of the game).</i></p>",
